{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411260","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1241126001:1":{"text":"When I was young, I was a beggar, a thief, and a pickpocket. I even fought stray dogs for scraps of bread.","source_cn":"我小时候当过乞丐、小偷、扒手。甚至为了一口面包，和野狗打架。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75C38337C8C9D1B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241126002:1":{"text":"To survive, I had to cut my hair and dress like a boy, because boys found work easier and were less likely to be targeted.","source_cn":"为了活下去，我不得不剪掉头发扮成男孩子，因为男孩更好找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72BAC3E4078F8664","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1241126002":{"text":"To survive, I had to cut my hair and dress like a boy, because boys found work easier and were less likely to be targeted.","source_cn":"为了活下去，我不得不剪掉头发扮成男孩子，因为男孩更好找工作，而且不会被盯上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72BAC3E4078F8664","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241126003:1":{"text":"There are plenty of kids like me in Rustport, but I'd say I was one of the lucky ones.","source_cn":"锈锚港有很多像我这样的孩子，我是幸运的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CAC46EEBA78AAE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241126004:1":{"text":"When Tesio first adopted me, he also thought I was a boy.","source_cn":"泰西欧收养我时，一开始也以为我是男孩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4782BC87E6CCC206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241126005:1":{"text":"By the time he realized I was a girl, I'd already proven myself more capable than the other boys he'd taken in.","source_cn":"等他发现我是女孩时，我已经比他收养的其他男孩都要优秀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01C38D5BDBC68FB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241126006:1":{"text":"I am who I am today because of my past, and I won't be ashamed of it.","source_cn":"我的过去铸造了今天的我，我从不为过去感到羞耻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6FEE75EF1AE88DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241126007:1":{"text":"Instead, I thank the Sonja from the past, the one who fought hard to survive and created the person I am now.","source_cn":"相反，我感谢过去的索尼娅，她想尽办法活下来，才有了现在的我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF98EF05E927143EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241126008:1":{"text":"Wow... Sonja is so resilient!","source_cn":"哇……索尼娅好、好强大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE005D5A5879864A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1241126009:1":{"text":"What a powerful story!","source_cn":"好有力的发言！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC129FF9FFC0CAF5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241126010:1":{"text":"To be honest, I've envied those who are born without ever having to worry where they'll find their next meal.","source_cn":"坦白说，我也羡慕过那些一生下来就不用为吃喝发愁的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7236808DE75DDEA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241126011:1":{"text":"They don't have to keep moving when they're totally out of options.","source_cn":"他们不像我，因为没有后路，所以必须往前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x163C882AAB6BCF2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1241126011":{"text":"They don't have to keep moving when they're totally out of options.","source_cn":"他们不像我，因为没有后路，所以必须往前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x163C882AAB6BCF2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241126012:1":{"text":"I used to, but I've come to level out.","source_cn":"也有过，后来我想通了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7462B86AE24E88A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241126013:1":{"text":"Destiny's Call is a hemp rope fastened to the wall by the forces of time and family.","source_cn":"命运，是被时代和家庭钉在墙上的麻绳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81A6A57C620BEE83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241126014:1":{"text":"But aside from those fixed and unchangeable points, I can rotate my wrist and hold onto the rope tightly.","source_cn":"但除了那些无法改变的定点，我可以转动手腕，紧紧拽住绳子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x046E8BD1B1DE0EA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1241126015:1":{"text":"Whatever I'm missing, I'll take for myself.","source_cn":"我所缺失的，我会亲手拿到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47EC922912EBD1E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241126016:1":{"text":"Besides, I have Nara; she is my family.","source_cn":"更何况，我还有奈拉，她就是我的家人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35378FCBD596EFD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1241126017:1":{"text":"I'll never forget the times we've spent lifting each other up.","source_cn":"我永远无法忘记，我们互相支撑度过的那段时光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x185E7FB2EF284FE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1241126018:1":{"text":"Guess she must not have forgotten either, which is why she's come back to look for me.","source_cn":"她不是也忘不了吗？所以现在回来找我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE8F58AEBB168CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1241126019:1":{"text":"Sonja, this dark humor doesn't suit you...","source_cn":"索尼娅，这个冷笑话不好笑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B2D3FD2D814ADBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1241126020:1":{"text":"I owe Nara many apologies... I hope in time I can make things up to her.","source_cn":"你们知道的，奈拉……我对不起她。希望能有机会弥补她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5672856F4E716E89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1241126021:1":{"text":"We know you can do it!","source_cn":"我们相信你能做到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE25C242FF60E6632","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1241126022:1":{"text":"You're right, I can... I must.","source_cn":"对……我能做到。我应该做到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x814D11CC33B5024A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"Do you feel resentful?","source_cn":"不会怨恨吗","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC32DE107FB53A079","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Do you feel resentful?","female":"Do you feel resentful?","variant_male_record_index":"66534","variant_female_record_index":"66535","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:1:2":{"text":"Don't you find it unfair?","source_cn":"不会觉得不公平吗","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x90AF7F34AAD2EFAC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Don't you find it unfair?","female":"Don't you find it unfair?","variant_male_record_index":"66536","variant_female_record_index":"66537","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"That must've been difficult.","source_cn":"听起来好辛苦","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5FD170EAA6D80361","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That must've been difficult.","female":"That must've been difficult.","variant_male_record_index":"66530","variant_female_record_index":"66531","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"Very sad...","source_cn":"好可怜","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6F19DED0EF7049B5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Very sad...","female":"Very sad...","variant_male_record_index":"66532","variant_female_record_index":"66533","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_ti